Rocinante — fork attribution and acknowledgments

This software is a fork of the work of many contributors.

Upstream lineage:

- pi-web by agegr (https://github.com/agegr/pi-web), MIT — original web UI
- ompweb by kahme247 (https://github.com/kahme247/ompweb), MIT — adapted for
  the oh-my-pi (omp) coding agent
- Rocinante by lucaspdude (https://github.com/lucaspdude/ompweb), MIT — personal
  fork rebranded as Rocinante; adds the first-run onboarding wizard, install
  packaging, right sidebar (Files + Changes), Brazilian Portuguese
  localization, access-key protection, CLI installer (Azure CLI + GitHub CLI),
  Git SSH key management (GitHub / GitLab / Azure DevOps), and generic SSH
  server connections.

Rocinante is a web UI for the `omp` (oh-my-pi) coding agent. The underlying
`omp` binary lives at https://github.com/can1357/oh-my-pi and is a separate
product by the oh-my-pi maintainer; Rocinante only drives it via RPC.

UI primitives are built on @base-ui/react (MIT) and lucide-react (ISC/0BSD).

